{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1305545-8-again-and-9-again-roll","id":1305545,"title":"8 again and 9 again roll","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-17T13:42:19-07:00","id":1305545,"title":"8 again and 9 again roll","content":"Does the rule works only on the first roll or does It work until you have no more success left?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-17T14:03:46-07:00","id":1305552,"title":"","content":"If you have 9-Again on a roll and you roll a 9, and you keep the success, reroll the die and get another 9, you keep the new success and reroll it again. Repeat until the die shows less than 9. Same goes for the usual 10-Again rule on most normal rolls.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-18T19:06:59-07:00","id":1305878,"title":"","content":"Yeah, which indeed does mean that if you have 8-again, you keep re-rolling every success die (adding to your total amount of successes) until you no longer roll a success.<br /> <br /> So you roll four dice and you roll 9, 6, 2 and 1, you roll the 9 again. this time you roll an 8, so roll again. 10, so roll again. another 8, roll again. Ah, 7 this time, so no more re-rolls. You got 4 successes in total!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24044-ventrue-life","name":"Ventrue Life","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24044_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"386"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}